A||N||0||87FieroGT||Is there any Fieros in Austin Texas??||||1||
Z||000000||87FieroGT||07-31-2000||12:21 PM||||Hey all you texans.  I had to take a road trip from the Rio Grande Valley to Austin so I decided to take my Fiero.  I was kinda disappointed though because the whole trip I never saw one Fiero on the road.  The only time I saw some Fieros they were parked next to a mobile home with waist high grass around them.  I wanted to put a post before I left to see if I could meet any of you guys that are on here but I didn't have the time.  Oh well, maybe next time there will actually be some others out on the road.  I did get plenty of looks from other people and even had a guy ask me what kind of car it was.  Hope to hear from some of you from Austin.<P>     Yellow 87FieroGT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Open12.jpg"> ||||reg||1
